# The base merge (issue #967, docs/design.md "The base merge") keeps both sides' added lines of these files, the base
# branch's first, with no job: the migration lists, which only grow. Read by the hopper only; git's own merge ignores it.
src/store/migrations-recent.ts hopper-merge=additions
src/store/tenant-migrations-recent.ts hopper-merge=additions
# The hopper CLI for Windows (issue #712): cmd and PowerShell read these files with Windows line endings.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
